The app does not ship these files directly. packages/ui/scripts/build-pieces.ts
recolours them at build time (black paint to --color-piece-dark, white paint to
--color-piece-light) into packages/ui/src/board/pieces.generated.ts, and a test
fails if that module drifts from these files. The /licenses page carries the
notice below.

